# Tanaris (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and manuals whose SOURCE is physically in
# Tanaris for a Horde player, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Sixteen recipes are
# vendor-sold by in-zone neutral vendors (Alchemist Pestlezugg, Vizzklick,
# Gikkix, Jabbey, Fizzgrimble and Dirge Quikcleave — all faction AH, so
# Horde buys at the same counters as the Alliance side); nine
# Leatherworking patterns drop each from named in-zone mobs, seven of them
# from the Wastewander camps in the east. The two same-title Crimson Silk
# Robe patterns are both sold by Vizzklick and both ship with a note. Every
# buy line carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor. Quest records
# carry no reward data, so no quest-reward recipe ships (see
# docs/tanaris-horde-companions-inventory.md). Trainer-taught staples are
# excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is
# gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. No in-zone
# Horde source exists for Blacksmithing, Engineering, Enchanting, First
# Aid or Fishing, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tanaris-horde-recipes
title Tanaris (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 38-50
zone Tanaris
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords tanaris, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Gadgetzan vendors - Pestlezugg's stock (Alchemy)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Alchemist Pestlezugg (50.89, 26.96) sells recipes in Gadgetzan; Steamwheedle-neutral, same counter both factions use.
  buy 6057 "Recipe: Nature Protection Potion" npc 5594
  buy 9303 "Recipe: Philosopher's Stone" npc 5594
  buy 9304 "Recipe: Transmute Iron to Gold" npc 5594
  buy 9305 "Recipe: Transmute Mithril to Truesilver" npc 5594
  buy 12958 "Recipe: Transmute Arcanite" npc 5594

step Gadgetzan vendors - Vizzklick's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Vizzklick (51.01, 27.36) sells patterns in Gadgetzan; Steamwheedle-neutral, same counter both factions use.
  buy 7088 "Pattern: Crimson Silk Robe" npc 6568
  buy 21358 "Pattern: Soul Pouch" npc 6568
  buy 217244 "Pattern: Crimson Silk Robe" npc 6568
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag" npc 6568
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag" npc 6568
  note Two same-title Crimson Silk Robe patterns share this vendor's stock - both are genuine in-zone sources, so both ship.

