  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Gikkix (66.64, 22.08) sells recipes at Steamwheedle Port; Steamwheedle-neutral, same counter both factions use.
  buy 13939 "Recipe: Spotted Yellowtail" npc 8137
  buy 13942 "Recipe: Grilled Squid" npc 8137
  buy 13945 "Recipe: Nightfin Soup" npc 8137
  buy 13946 "Recipe: Poached Sunscale Salmon" npc 8137

step Steamwheedle Port vendors - Jabbey's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Jabbey (67.01, 21.99) sells recipes at Steamwheedle Port; Steamwheedle-neutral, same counter both factions use.
  buy 16767 "Recipe: Undermine Clam Chowder" npc 8139

step Gadgetzan vendors - the steak (Cooking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Innkeeper Fizzgrimble (52.51, 27.91) and Dirge Quikcleave (52.63, 28.11) both sell the steak in Gadgetzan; both Steamwheedle-neutral.
  buy 18046 "Recipe: Tender Wolf Steak" npc 7733
  note Dirge Quikcleave (8125) stocks the same recipe at his own counter; either neutral vendor serves.

step Wastewander camp drops (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip The Wastewander camps work the east; Andre Firebeard holds the cove. All droppers below spawn only in Tanaris.
  collect 8395 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Breastplate" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Bandits (13 points, east).
  collect 8397 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Bracers" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Shadow Mages (22 points, east).
  collect 8398 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Gloves" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Thieves (20 points, east).
  collect 8399 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Boots" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Rogues (20 points, east).
  collect 8401 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Leggings" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Rogues (same camp).
  collect 8400 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Shoulders" optional
  note Off the Wastewander Assassins (10 points), the Scofflaw (66.16, 34.99), or Andre Firebeard (73.37, 47.14).
  collect 8402 "Pattern: Tough Scorpid Helm" optional
  note Off the same three sources as the Shoulders.

step Cove and south-west drops (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  collect 17722 "Pattern: Gloves of the Greatfather" optional
  note Off the Southsea Freebooters (22 points), sole dropper, Lost Rigger Cove pirates.
  collect 252908 "Pattern: Supple Scorpid Boots" optional
  note Off the Dunemaul Ogres (10 points, south-west), sole dropper.

step Professions with no Tanaris source

  zone map 1446

  note Blacksmithing, Engineering, Enchanting, First Aid and Fishing have no recipe source physically in Tanaris for a Horde player - no vendor sells them in-zone and no narrow in-zone dropper carries them. This guide stays silent on those professions rather than padding.
